before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java

public class Main {
  static class Session implements AutoCloseable {
    void use() { System.out.println("using"); }
    public void close() { System.out.println("closed"); }
  }
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    try (Session session = new Session()) {
      session.use();
    }
    System.out.println("after");
  }
}
```

